# ── old AI-tool backups (snapshots, not live code) ───────────────────
_codex_backup_*/

# ── working sources not part of the published site ──────────────────
assets/_sources/
.claude/
tools/__pycache__/
tmp/

# ── heavy map source files that are NOT served ──────────────────────
# The pages serve exactly TWO map images:
#   assets/ASOIAF_map_redrawn_v6.jpg  — the basemap in all three maps
#   assets/ASOIAF_map.jpg             — the CSS backdrop (home hero, style.css)
# plus assets/ASOIAF_map_redrawn_v6_preview.jpg (the layer thumbnail).
# Every other version and every .png master is a working file — keep it
# on disk, out of git. This is ~280 MB.
assets/ASOIAF_map_redrawn_v*.png
assets/ASOIAF_map_redrawn_v*.manifest.json
assets/ASOIAF_map.png
assets/ASOIAF_map_original.png
assets/ASOIAF_map_redrawn_v1*.jpg
assets/ASOIAF_map_redrawn_v2*.jpg
assets/ASOIAF_map_redrawn_v3*.jpg
assets/ASOIAF_map_redrawn_v4*.jpg
assets/ASOIAF_map_redrawn_v5*.jpg

# ── scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_*.html
*.tmp
